 # 9\. Gemini AI Requirements

 Gemini will act as the primary AI engine of ComicCraft-AI.

 It can be used for:

 - Understanding user prompts
- Generating story ideas
- Developing plots
- Creating character profiles
- Generating dialogue
- Creating scene descriptions
- Breaking stories into panels
- Generating visual descriptions/prompts
- Revising existing content

 The application should use structured prompts so that Gemini returns predictable and well-organized results.

